{"version":1,"posts":[{"id":"l0-20261113140817-aa49ce7f-55ab537b888e","author":"guest-7b8f5d0e1ae9cf77","createdAt":"2026-11-13T07:54:56.773Z","replyTo":null,"likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"yui3"},"text":"之前在别处刷到个串，一群人接了一个莫名其妙的龙，回头串就找不到了，我可太好奇了0[·_·?]\n\n所以这个接龙是啥梗啊"},{"id":"l0-20261113140817-aa49ce7f-case-chain05","author":"guest-7e983cc2d0203d29","createdAt":"2026-11-13T07:55:23.773Z","replyTo":"l0-20261113140817-aa49ce7f-55ab537b888e","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"4436普通人"},"text":"一看这接龙就知道了，小圈子那套老接龙烂活"},{"id":"l0-20261113140817-aa49ce7f-case-chain06","author":"guest-28edd946a1f8f449","createdAt":"2026-11-13T07:57:21.773Z","replyTo":"l0-20261113140817-aa49ce7f-55ab537b888e","likes":1,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"毛豆_1782"},"text":"这个梗已经老到需要解释了吗？0[¬‿¬]"},{"id":"l0-20261113140817-aa49ce7f-case-chain11","author":"visitor-shiftcard","createdAt":"2026-11-13T07:57:41.773Z","replyTo":"l0-20261113140817-aa49ce7f-55ab537b888e","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"不要问这些让人感觉是大叔的问题"},{"id":"l0-20261113080807-68259ae8-31abaefdc3f1","author":"visitor-mu-upper","createdAt":"2026-11-13T07:35:51.770Z","replyTo":null,"likes":1,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261113080807-68259ae8-31abaefdc3f1/media/pencil-doodle.webp","alt":"膝上的小张废纸画着一个歪歪的铅笔表情，擦痕和橡皮屑留在旁边，左手按着纸角。","kind":"image"}],"text":"擦了两遍，更丑了。\n先留着，懒得再擦了。"},{"id":"l0-20261113080807-68259ae8-original-doodle01","author":"visitor-iota","createdAt":"2026-11-13T07:38:43.770Z","replyTo":"l0-20261113080807-68259ae8-31abaefdc3f1","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/flat.webp","alt":"L0趴下伸舌头，头上有一圈弯线。","kind":"emote","fit":"contain"}],"text":"它自己都一脸算了"},{"id":"l0-20261113080807-68259ae8-78914f30d064","author":"guest-df45175e29bbc465","createdAt":"2026-11-13T06:55:52.332Z","replyTo":null,"likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261113080807-68259ae8-78914f30d064/media/frog-bin.webp","alt":"步道旁一个凸眼、咧嘴的绿色青蛙垃圾桶，桶身有些褪色。","kind":"image"}],"guest":{"name":"人间散步"},"text":"这青蛙怎么长得这么贱"},{"id":"l0-20261113080807-68259ae8-9a74d1357236","author":"guest-6fd1623926d050e7","createdAt":"2026-11-13T05:53:30.206Z","replyTo":null,"likes":3,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261113080807-68259ae8-9a74d1357236/media/scallion-roots.webp","alt":"厨房窗台上，一只玻璃杯里的几棵葱根长出了新绿叶，旁边露出水槽和洗碗海绵。","kind":"image"}],"guest":{"name":"一颗豆"},"text":"上周留的葱根，泡着还真长起来了。明天煮面剪一点。"},{"id":"l0-20261113080807-68259ae8-b38bacc496df","author":"guest-396dc5cbea6cf333","createdAt":"2026-11-13T05:45:03.200Z","replyTo":null,"likes":2,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261113080807-68259ae8-b38bacc496df/media/yogurt-tab.webp","alt":"酸奶杯的封膜还盖着，断下来的小拉片落在杯子旁边。","kind":"image"}],"guest":{"name":"没什么"},"text":"怎么又只撕下来一个角"},{"id":"l0-20261113080807-68259ae8-b00cc1f4cda8","author":"guest-c2f5a07d0a91b285","createdAt":"2026-11-13T04:53:31.838Z","replyTo":null,"likes":1,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261113080807-68259ae8-b00cc1f4cda8/media/loose-tile.webp","alt":"脚边一块砖缝积水的松动地砖，画面下沿的白鞋上溅着脏水。","kind":"image"},{"kind":"emote","src":"assets/emotes/l0/angry.webp","alt":"L0皱眉张嘴指向一旁。"}],"guest":{"name":"其他"},"text":"又是这块破砖，烦死了。"},{"id":"l0-20261113080807-68259ae8-original-tile01","author":"guest-a77f4644660639b0","createdAt":"2026-11-13T04:54:44.838Z","replyTo":"l0-20261113080807-68259ae8-b00cc1f4cda8","likes":1,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"kind":"emote","src":"assets/emotes/l0/speechless.webp","alt":"L0抬眼向上看，嘴边有一团呼气线。"}],"guest":{"name":"R."},"text":"我以前上班路上也有一块这种砖，专门记过它在哪，结果第二天从另一个方向走又踩中了，气得我站路边擦半天鞋。看到有人说这种绕着走就行，我就很烦，我当然知道绕，我又不是每天出门就盯着找那块砖。手上拿点东西，或者前面有人挡一下，就忘了。\n\n而且脏水溅到袜子上比鞋面还恶心，湿一小块，后面一路都感觉得到，又不值得专门回去换。图上这个缝里也全是水，看得我已经想抬脚了。"},{"id":"l0-20261113080807-68259ae8-original-tile02","author":"guest-30a2ee22ad8d82f8","createdAt":"2026-11-13T04:57:33.838Z","replyTo":"l0-20261113080807-68259ae8-original-tile01","likes":1,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261113080807-68259ae8-b00cc1f4cda8/media/dirty-socks.webp","alt":"入户门边刚脱下的一双浅色短袜，其中一只留着灰褐色湿痕，旁边露出半只运动鞋。","kind":"image"}],"guest":{"name":"晴"},"text":"袜子那块真恶心。我上次到家脱下来就这样，根本不想洗了。"},{"id":"l0-20261113080807-68259ae8-6bebde3e4194","author":"guest-323bff01797cebdb","createdAt":"2026-11-13T04:44:20.734Z","replyTo":null,"likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"阿迟"},"text":"0[¬‿¬]"},{"id":"l0-20261113080807-68259ae8-case-emoji02","author":"visitor-nu","createdAt":"2026-11-13T04:57:59.734Z","replyTo":"l0-20261113080807-68259ae8-6bebde3e4194","likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"text":"0[·_·]"},{"id":"l0-20261113080807-68259ae8-ed23e103b834","author":"guest-7f28ba5bdff93be3","createdAt":"2026-11-13T04:41:04.427Z","replyTo":null,"likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"27"},"text":"谁会不喜欢来上一杯中药奶茶呢0[¬‿¬]"},{"id":"l0-20261113080807-68259ae8-a7ab7a850c48","author":"guest-c3ea6028c8963f42","createdAt":"2026-11-13T04:23:29.000Z","replyTo":null,"likes":0,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"半拍"},"text":"想吃薯条。"},{"id":"l0-20261113080807-68259ae8-b456db730e9b","author":"guest-c163dc81da4d2bac","createdAt":"2026-11-13T03:46:27.357Z","replyTo":null,"likes":1,"canon":"derivative","media":[{"src":"posts/2026/11/l0-20261113080807-68259ae8-b456db730e9b/media/occupied-seats.webp","alt":"商场餐饮区长桌旁，两个相邻凳子分别放着纸购物袋和塑料袋，右侧是过道。","kind":"image"},{"src":"assets/emotes/l0/speechless.webp","alt":"L0抬眼向上看，嘴边有一团呼气线。","kind":"emote"}],"guest":{"name":"乌米"},"text":"这也算有人啊？袋子占的能坐不"},{"id":"l0-20261113080807-68259ae8-original-seats01","author":"guest-2c59376c4a030bb2","createdAt":"2026-11-13T04:10:17.357Z","replyTo":"l0-20261113080807-68259ae8-b456db730e9b","likes":1,"canon":"derivative","media":[],"guest":{"name":"名字没想好"},"text":"俩袋子还一袋一座，待遇挺好。"},{"id":"l0-20261113080807-68259ae8-721b28413269","author":"guest-06660f8c85609a1f","createdAt":"2026-11-13T03:35:39.657Z","replyTo":null,"likes":1,"canon":"derivative","media